        "macro": "{\n  async resultChosen(component, preview) {\n    await game.modules.get(\"beavers-artificers-crafting\").api.resolve(component, preview);\n  }\n}",
        "folder": "Artificer Plans (Level 2+)",
        "instruction": "<p>A plan of Replicate Magic Item (D&amp;D 2024 Artificer, level 2+).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Learn the plan: put this recipe on the Artificer. Removing it from the actor makes its items vanish.</li>\n<li>Requires Tinker's Tools and Artificer level 2.</li>\n<li>Costs one item of Replicate Magic Item until the next long rest (see the Script \"Replicate Magic Item\").</li>\n<li>More items than the Artificer level allows: the oldest one vanishes.</li>\n<li>You can learn this plan several times, a different item each time: copy the recipe and keep one result.</li>\n</ul>"
      }
